      "id": "claim_f70c497685544fd293c0611bdae3805c",
      "statement": "PlayerRuntime.observeMoodSlotCaches (started from start() after the startup sequence, deliberately low-frequency and non-blocking) continuously collects timeSlotConfigRepository.observeConfigs() into @Volatile moodSlotConfigsCache and songEmotionRepository.observeAll() — a Room invalidation stream mapped per song in a single pass into two @Volatile ratio maps (moodEmotionRatiosCache from emotionMatchRatiosOf for slot matching/refill, exploreVoteRatiosCache from emotionVoteRatiosOf for explore vote tallying) on flowOn(Default); it also collects wordPreferenceRepository.observeAll() into wordPreferenceCache and observes randomEnhanceMode into randomEnhanceModeCache / isExploreModeActive (leaving EXPLORE stops any explore session). Config saves/deletes and emotion analysis/calibration therefore take effect on the next random draw with no manual refresh (M-2) and the facade reads these caches with zero DataStore IO (N-3).",
