    {
      "id": "claim_d513d553edc94aca8060354124b4e146",
      "statement": "PlayerRandomQueueFacade.filterByMoodTags filters at the planner entry: it keeps a song when any (word, ratio) in moodEmotionTagRatiosOf(song) has word in mood.tags and ratio >= MATCH_MIN_RATIO (MoodSlotPolicy.MATCH_MIN_RATIO = 0.35), where the ratio is the word's fraction of the whole song from emotionMatchRatiosOf and manual-tag songs carry 1.0 for every tag (so they always match); the default moodEmotionTagRatiosOf derives each word as 1.0 from moodEmotionTagsOf, preserving plain-OR behavior for callers that don't inject ratios. An empty result returns null and the caller falls back to full-library random (logged \"fall back to full library\") instead of failing to start, while a pool below POOL_WARN_THRESHOLD logs a \"will loop\" warning with the filter still applying.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://feature/player/src/main/java/cn/com/dcsgo/mihx/feature/player/PlayerRandomQueueFacade.kt#L46-L59",
